## 🔐 9. Safety and Investigation Notes

- Run investigation commands on your own Windows device or an authorized lab.
- Prefer read-only commands during initial triage.
- Do not terminate processes simply because their names look unfamiliar.
- Do not upload command lines or logs containing passwords, tokens, or personal information.
- A suspicious indicator requires investigation; it is not automatically proof of compromise.

